[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3391947133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-3391947133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":3391947133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KLQF9","user":{"login":"FFF27","id":19473020,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDczMDIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19473020?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27","html_url":"https://github.com/FFF27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-10T19:13:48Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T19:13:48Z","body":"Consistent with existing behavior would be either `x=0` meaning disabled, or defaulting to -1 and using `x < 0` to mean disabled.\r\n\r\nAlso, would you mind updating `doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml` to explain how to use this feature? `corner_smoothing_strength` seems somewhat arbitrary - what range of values do you expect?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3391947133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392832889","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-3392832889","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":3392832889,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KOoV5","user":{"login":"tsutsen","id":68827291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODI3Mjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68827291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen","html_url":"https://github.com/tsutsen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T02:56:59Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T03:12:03Z","body":"> Consistent with existing behavior would be either x=0 meaning disabled, or defaulting to -1 and using x < 0 to mean disabled.\r\n\r\nIn the last commits, I've got rid of the `corner_smoothing_enabled` and adapted the formula from the [CSS docs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/superellipse). The default value there is `1.0`, which basically coresponds to '100% rounded' and produces regular rounded corners. Increasing the smoothing value gradually makes corners approach a perfect square -- around `2.0` it looks like a squircle, and beyond `10.0` the shape is almost indistinguishable from a square. That's why `10` is the higher threshold for `corner_radius_smoothing`. The lower threshold is `0.0` because below `0.0` antialiasing and border width calculations break -- antialiasing vanishes and corner borders become thin.\r\n\r\n> would you mind updating doc/classes/StyleBoxFlat.xml to explain how to use this feature?\r\n\r\nOf course! I've added the docs entry. Should we also mention the source I've adapted the formula and descriptions from ([CSS docs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/superellipse))?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3392832889/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393213364","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-3393213364","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":3393213364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KQFO0","user":{"login":"tsutsen","id":68827291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODI3Mjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68827291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen","html_url":"https://github.com/tsutsen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T11:13:10Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T11:16:31Z","body":"Here's an example of how different corner smoothing values look. I'm not sure how critical it is that with `corner_radius_smoothing = 0` border width is significantly smaller around the corners, and with `corner_radius_smoothing > 1.0` it's slightly larger. \r\n\r\nWe can either set the `corner_radius_smoothing` lower threshold to `1.0` so that this issue is less noticeable, or rework border width calculation. \r\n\r\nMost likely, in the latter case, issues with concave corners I mentioned earlier will also be fixed and we'll gain an ability to draw astroids (`n<0`) in-editor. However, I haven't looked into that thoroughly yet.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"480\" height=\"519\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-11 154239 (Small)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f042314a-2d04-4d93-bb75-79e60ef47f72\" />","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393213364/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393570656","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-3393570656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":3393570656,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KRcdg","user":{"login":"FFF27","id":19473020,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDczMDIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19473020?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27","html_url":"https://github.com/FFF27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FFF27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T18:27:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T18:27:36Z","body":"You're failing the automatic tests, see https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html#using-clang-format-locally for how to run those tests locally before committing.\r\n\r\nI don't see the point in arbitrarily limiting the max value to 10. You should allow any value that doesn't outright break things. You can use the property_hint `,or_less,or_greater` to allow manually entering custom values outside the slider's visible range, see https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_%40globalscope.html#enum-globalscope-propertyhint","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393570656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414460228","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-3414460228","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":3414460228,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LhIdE","user":{"login":"Voxybuns","id":42387308,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzg3MzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42387308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns","html_url":"https://github.com/Voxybuns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T08:40:04Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T08:42:59Z","body":"i love you. (platonically)\r\n\r\nedit: shame about values <0 not being allowed due to breaking rendering code, it would allow for some neat effects like notched or scooped corners, but i'll happily take my squircles :)\r\n<img width=\"477\" height=\"359\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c3b1e11-5db1-4c6f-884e-0ffcaf43f132\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3414460228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415281643","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-3415281643","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":3415281643,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LkQ_r","user":{"login":"tsutsen","id":68827291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODI3Mjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68827291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen","html_url":"https://github.com/tsutsen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T12:07:56Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T12:07:56Z","body":"> shame about values <0 not being allowed\r\n\r\nI am currently trying to fix it, and there's some progress. I've already fixed the consistency of border widths across different `corner_radius_smoothing` values by:\r\n1. calculating normal unit vectors from each corner point and then \r\n2. multiplying them by `border_width`\r\n\r\nI am not sure how good of a solution this is though, because it changes current corner rounding logic and adds quite a bit of code. Anyhow, I'll tidy things up and make a commit soon I hope. AA is still kinda broken but there's some progress too.\r\n\r\nAnd about the alternatives to the normals-based-solution: the one I've got is to create a heuristic to draw parallel-looking border lines. Here are the equations I've prepared in Desmos: https://www.desmos.com/calculator/qcqzysryq4. Maybe this approach would be more efficient but the results will be less accurate and stable I believe.\r\n\r\n> You're failing the automatic tests\r\n\r\nThank you for the link! I've missed the pre-commit part somehow.\r\n\r\n> You should allow any value that doesn't outright break things\r\n\r\nAgreed, will do!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3415281643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433719311","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-3433719311","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":3433719311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MqmYP","user":{"login":"tsutsen","id":68827291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODI3Mjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68827291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen","html_url":"https://github.com/tsutsen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsutsen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-22T18:36:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T19:00:47Z","body":"Just pushed the best version I've got so far. Things workng properly:\r\n\r\n- [x] per-corner smoothing in unlimited range\r\n- [x] consistent border thickness with different border_width and different corner_radius values\r\n- [x] skew\r\n- [x] blend\r\n- [x] anitaliasing *\r\n- [x] shadows *\r\n- [x] draw center\r\n- [x] expand margins\r\n\r\n## Known issues\r\nThe things marked with * start to break when smoothing < 1. In such cases, AA doesn't work on corners, and shadow is missing on corners as well. I'll post some screenshots with the bugs later.\r\n\r\n## Solution summary\r\nThe main idea of the smoothing solution: inner border is drawn as a classic superellipse and outer border is adjusted to look parallel to it. I've documented the process of fitting the outer curve [in this notebok](https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1u3evfnJoQM4q8afAgsF1_UltLaN78aJU?usp=sharing).\r\n\r\n## Comparison with other approaches\r\n\r\nIssues and benefits of the approaches I've tried:\r\n\r\n**Offset from an inner border:** \r\n+ Too intrusive. Complex curvature and offset adjustments needed. What's worse, these adjustments happen outside draw_rounded_rectangle function and clutter the main draw method. Alien logic. Many hard to catch (and fix) bugs\r\n+ Consistent border widths (but very prone to breakage)\r\n+ Beveled borders when smoothing < 1.0\r\n\r\n**Offset from an outer border:**\r\n+ Even more intrusive. Messes with draw order. Headache with swapping inner and outer rects everywhere when use_smoothing = true and even more bizarre offsets/curvature coefficients needed. \r\n+ Consistent border widths (but very prone to breakage)\r\n+ Fixes beveled borders \r\n\r\n**Adjusted superellipse formula (current approach):**\r\n+ Minimally intrusive. Follows the existing logic and is quite clear I believe. Doesn't require much changes (compared to other approaches).\r\n+ Border widths are less consistent but extremely more robust. Some tuning left to do but it's quite okay in general, I think.\r\n\r\nHere's how different smoothing values look now. All drawn with corner_radius = 32 and border_width = 3.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"610\" height=\"480\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-22 222434 (Small)\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b2c9566-ba98-4c22-9be8-4acd1de8bae4\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n_P.S. it turned out to be way harder than I initially thought..._","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3433719311/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3443910639","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-3443910639","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":3443910639,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NRefv","user":{"login":"Voxybuns","id":42387308,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzg3MzA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42387308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns","html_url":"https://github.com/Voxybuns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voxybuns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T16:07:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T16:07:09Z","body":"very excited to see your progress on this! i cannot wait for this to get merged","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3443910639/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274879778","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111483#issuecomment-4274879778","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111483","id":4274879778,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-zX0i","user":{"login":"PIXEL-GAME-DEV","id":105152340,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkR_VA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105152340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV","html_url":"https://github.com/PIXEL-GAME-DEV","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIXEL-GAME-DEV/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-19T00:48:48Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T00:48:48Z","body":"I would like this pr to have separate corner smoothing for each corner, would that be possible?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4274879778/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]